WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.588 --> 00:00:08.466
Damn, Angelyne, it's so big.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:12.762
I bet people will talk about
this a hundred years from now.

00:00:16.641 --> 00:00:18.101
Oh, oh my God.

00:00:18.101 --> 00:00:19.602
It’s working.

00:00:20.979 --> 00:00:24.441
Since I was a girl, I've known
that fame is my destiny.

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:26.985
Huge, gigantic fame.

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:30.780
And so I said, “I'm going to
get the love of the world.”

00:00:32.615 --> 00:00:34.701
Billboards are popping
 up around the city

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:38.121
featuring the striking image
 of a blonde with a single name.

00:00:39.039 --> 00:00:42.167
Angelyne.

00:00:42.542 --> 00:00:44.210
The billboard queen?  Uhhh.

00:00:44.461 --> 00:00:45.253
Yes.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:48.673
But it can be hard
 when you become famous.

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.091
A lot of people

00:00:50.091 --> 00:00:52.635
want to be a part of it
no matter what it takes.

00:00:52.635 --> 00:00:55.388
So they'll say and write
 just about anything.

00:00:55.388 --> 00:00:57.015
She was the devil in disguise.

00:00:57.015 --> 00:00:58.308
My dad paid for those.

00:00:58.308 --> 00:01:00.060
Money is her bottom line,
not people.

00:01:00.560 --> 00:01:02.187
I'd love to be like Barbie.

00:01:02.187 --> 00:01:04.481
She won't cry, she doesn't hurt.

00:01:04.481 --> 00:01:06.524
You're crazy!  I'm done!

00:01:06.983 --> 00:01:09.402
Contrary to what people think...

00:01:11.863 --> 00:01:13.907
I'm actually very private

00:01:13.907 --> 00:01:16.076
and people should respect that. 

00:01:18.495 --> 00:01:20.497
Everybody wanted to know,
 who is this woman? 

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:23.458
You'd look up in the sky
 and there she was.

00:01:23.833 --> 00:01:26.377
This whole Angelyne story
starts with me.

00:01:26.503 --> 00:01:27.754
That did not happen. 

00:01:27.754 --> 00:01:29.255
He's completely delusional. 

00:01:30.548 --> 00:01:33.718
When Angelyne showed up,
 LA needed her.

00:01:35.095 --> 00:01:37.097
Who is the real Angelyne?

00:01:37.097 --> 00:01:38.807
Don't you like the not knowing? 

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:42.644
I remember that so differently.

00:01:42.644 --> 00:01:43.353
Hm, hm, ha.

00:01:47.023 --> 00:01:48.817
I’m something that you
 have to experience. 

00:01:48.817 --> 00:01:49.275
Ha.

00:01:49.275 --> 00:01:49.818
Oohh.

00:01:50.485 --> 00:01:52.195
I'm an innocent little doll.

00:01:52.445 --> 00:01:53.113
Oooh.

00:01:53.113 --> 00:01:53.738
Boom.

00:01:53.738 --> 00:01:54.781
Or a porn star.

00:01:55.281 --> 00:01:55.990
Ooooo.

00:01:57.367 --> 00:01:59.244
I’m whatever
 you want me to be.

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:04.707
But I do not want to be famous
 for something that I do,

00:02:04.707 --> 00:02:06.751
I want to be famous
for who I am.

00:02:07.168 --> 00:02:08.878
I am Angelyne.

00:02:12.841 --> 00:02:14.217
Angelyne, no, no, no!

00:02:16.261 --> 00:02:19.097
And that's the only
 story you need to know.

